        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore, Parkour, Save the world!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skybound is a game about exploration with an Exhilarating movement system.  Using Bells abilities to bring the world back together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skybound </strong>is a 3D exploration platformer focused on <strong>fun, fluid movement mechanics</strong>, parkour and environmental puzzle solving. You play as Bell, a young archaeologist exploring mystical floating islands in search of ancient artifacts. Use Bell's specialized equipment - including a <strong>Grappling Anchor</strong>, <strong>agility boots</strong>, and mastery over the magical &quot;<strong>Flow</strong>&quot; - to investigate ruins untouched by explorers for ages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swing </strong>through the sky, traverse the islands and meet its curious and whacky inhabitants. You've got a contract to fulfill and mysteries to unearth!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Please note that this is only ACT 1, more acts will be made if the game is positively received!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Skybound</strong> you can <strong>EXPLORE</strong> three different islands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205780/extras/af4a2864dfb384615bca155342d782de.poster.avif?t=1782831791\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205780/extras/af4a2864dfb384615bca155342d782de.webm?t=1782831791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205780/extras/af4a2864dfb384615bca155342d782de.mp4?t=1782831791\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By using Bell's <strong>GRAPPELING HOOK</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205780/extras/415235c0fc7e6df69a570d4dbeafbe2e.poster.avif?t=1782831791\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205780/extras/415235c0fc7e6df69a570d4dbeafbe2e.webm?t=1782831791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205780/extras/415235c0fc7e6df69a570d4dbeafbe2e.mp4?t=1782831791\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And once you've mastered the <strong>MOMENTUM</strong> and <strong>FLOW</strong> of the game you'll be <strong>FLYING</strong> like this:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205780/extras/6ec234242314883d764f0b8981626994.poster.avif?t=1782831791\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205780/extras/6ec234242314883d764f0b8981626994.webm?t=1782831791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205780/extras/6ec234242314883d764f0b8981626994.mp4?t=1782831791\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And Most importantly, <strong>you can destroy oh so many POTS!</strong> Some even contain <strong>collectibles!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205780/extras/16b8615484961626e06c8ca8f516d8e4.poster.avif?t=1782831791\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205780/extras/16b8615484961626e06c8ca8f516d8e4.webm?t=1782831791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205780/extras/16b8615484961626e06c8ca8f516d8e4.mp4?t=1782831791\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if your good enough you might make it to the global <strong>Steam Leaderboards!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205780/extras/87cfbc3905849681f6eedf6215387c42.avif?t=1782831791\" width=1560 height=964 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Story of Skybound</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bell wasn't <strong><i>exactly </i></strong>what Professor A. N. Curia - who studies anicent human civilization - expected to receive. Shipped to the Professor  archaeologist as <strong>&quot;Human Remains&quot;</strong>, the package contained something far more alive: a <strong>baby</strong>. Turns out, raising a human is <i>excellent </i>for research (and admittedly, pretty adorable).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Growing up, Bell took to her mentor/parent's work in a <strong>big </strong>way. She spent countless nights under the blanket reading about lost civilizations, and even more time tagging along on excavation trips. Eager as ever, she learned fast by studying artifacts, documenting ruins and decoding ancient texts. By <strong>seventeen</strong>, she'd shaped into a fine archaeologist in her own right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now she's got her<strong> very first solo job!</strong> The client came through Professor A. N. Curia, so they must be reputable. The mission is straightforward: retrieve an <strong>artifact </strong>from the ancient and mysterious sky islands and prove she's a real archaeologist. This is the beginning of something great!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But as Bell explores the floating ruins, something feels... <i>off</i>. Questions keep surfacing that don't <i>quite </i>add up. What exactly does the client want with this <strong>artifact</strong>? And why all the secrecy?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Please note: This is a student demo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skybound </strong>is a <strong>demo </strong>created over <i>6 weeks </i>by a multidisciplinary team of students from many different universities together for a semester at DADIU (Danish Academy of Digital, Interactive Entertainment). This project brought together aspiring developers, artists, designers and composers, all of whom have never worked on a game of this scale before, and with this tight of a schedule. <br> <br>While we're incredibly proud of what we've accomplished in such a short timeframe, you may encounter bugs or rough edges along the way. We appreciate your understanding and hope you enjoy exploring the sky islands with Bell despite any hiccups!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for playing our game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore, Parkour, Save the world!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skybound is a game about exploration with an Exhilarating movement system.  Using Bells abilities to bring the world back together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skybound </strong>is a 3D exploration platformer focused on <strong>fun, fluid movement mechanics</strong>, parkour and environmental puzzle solving. You play as Bell, a young archaeologist exploring mystical floating islands in search of ancient artifacts. Use Bell's specialized equipment - including a <strong>Grappling Anchor</strong>, <strong>agility boots</strong>, and mastery over the magical &quot;<strong>Flow</strong>&quot; - to investigate ruins untouched by explorers for ages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swing </strong>through the sky, traverse the islands and meet its curious and whacky inhabitants. You've got a contract to fulfill and mysteries to unearth!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Please note that this is only ACT 1, more acts will be made if the game is positively received!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Skybound</strong> you can <strong>EXPLORE</strong> three different islands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205780/extras/af4a2864dfb384615bca155342d782de.poster.avif?t=1782831791\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205780/extras/af4a2864dfb384615bca155342d782de.webm?t=1782831791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205780/extras/af4a2864dfb384615bca155342d782de.mp4?t=1782831791\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By using Bell's <strong>GRAPPELING HOOK</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205780/extras/415235c0fc7e6df69a570d4dbeafbe2e.poster.avif?t=1782831791\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205780/extras/415235c0fc7e6df69a570d4dbeafbe2e.webm?t=1782831791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205780/extras/415235c0fc7e6df69a570d4dbeafbe2e.mp4?t=1782831791\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And once you've mastered the <strong>MOMENTUM</strong> and <strong>FLOW</strong> of the game you'll be <strong>FLYING</strong> like this:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205780/extras/6ec234242314883d764f0b8981626994.poster.avif?t=1782831791\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205780/extras/6ec234242314883d764f0b8981626994.webm?t=1782831791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205780/extras/6ec234242314883d764f0b8981626994.mp4?t=1782831791\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And Most importantly, <strong>you can destroy oh so many POTS!</strong> Some even contain <strong>collectibles!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205780/extras/16b8615484961626e06c8ca8f516d8e4.poster.avif?t=1782831791\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205780/extras/16b8615484961626e06c8ca8f516d8e4.webm?t=1782831791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205780/extras/16b8615484961626e06c8ca8f516d8e4.mp4?t=1782831791\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if your good enough you might make it to the global <strong>Steam Leaderboards!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205780/extras/87cfbc3905849681f6eedf6215387c42.avif?t=1782831791\" width=1560 height=964 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Story of Skybound</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bell wasn't <strong><i>exactly </i></strong>what Professor A. N. Curia - who studies anicent human civilization - expected to receive. Shipped to the Professor  archaeologist as <strong>&quot;Human Remains&quot;</strong>, the package contained something far more alive: a <strong>baby</strong>. Turns out, raising a human is <i>excellent </i>for research (and admittedly, pretty adorable).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Growing up, Bell took to her mentor/parent's work in a <strong>big </strong>way. She spent countless nights under the blanket reading about lost civilizations, and even more time tagging along on excavation trips. Eager as ever, she learned fast by studying artifacts, documenting ruins and decoding ancient texts. By <strong>seventeen</strong>, she'd shaped into a fine archaeologist in her own right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now she's got her<strong> very first solo job!</strong> The client came through Professor A. N. Curia, so they must be reputable. The mission is straightforward: retrieve an <strong>artifact </strong>from the ancient and mysterious sky islands and prove she's a real archaeologist. This is the beginning of something great!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But as Bell explores the floating ruins, something feels... <i>off</i>. Questions keep surfacing that don't <i>quite </i>add up. What exactly does the client want with this <strong>artifact</strong>? And why all the secrecy?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Please note: This is a student demo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skybound </strong>is a <strong>demo </strong>created over <i>6 weeks </i>by a multidisciplinary team of students from many different universities together for a semester at DADIU (Danish Academy of Digital, Interactive Entertainment). This project brought together aspiring developers, artists, designers and composers, all of whom have never worked on a game of this scale before, and with this tight of a schedule. <br> <br>While we're incredibly proud of what we've accomplished in such a short timeframe, you may encounter bugs or rough edges along the way. We appreciate your understanding and hope you enjoy exploring the sky islands with Bell despite any hiccups!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for playing our game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
